    {"type":"text","id":"twotierT","x":594,"y":298,"width":344,"height":190,"text":"Two-tier audit  (allowlist wins):\n• content denylist — EllipticCurve,\n   IsDedekindDomain, ClassGroup, Cyclotomic\n• infra allowlist — WellFounded.fix,\n   Decidable, Nat.rec, SizeOf\n• elementary-by-fiat — legendreSym, Nat.gcd\n• axioms ⊆ {propext, Classical.choice,\n   Quot.sound}  → catches sorry (sorryAx)","originalText":"Two-tier audit  (allowlist wins):\n• content denylist — EllipticCurve,\n   IsDedekindDomain, ClassGroup, Cyclotomic\n• infra allowlist — WellFounded.fix,\n   Decidable, Nat.rec, SizeOf\n• elementary-by-fiat — legendreSym, Nat.gcd\n• axioms ⊆ {propext, Classical.choice,\n   Quot.sound}  → catches sorry (sorryAx)","fontSize":12.5,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"middle","strokeColor":"#22c55e","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":2081,"version":1,"versionNonce":2081,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":"twotier","lineHeight":1.35}
